==Battleground==
*1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be cleared with fodder units as Mr. Mole is LD and the Brollows are infrequent. If one is worried about Brollows stacking, a slightly stronger melee unit should be able to clear out the stage without issue.

